{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16215240","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16215240","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1621524001:1":{"text":"喵丽丝，你的野心太膨胀了。这不是带领大家走向自由，而是逼迫大家称你为王！","source_cn":"喵丽丝，你的野心太膨胀了。这不是带领大家走向自由，而是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F12D2B0BC8239E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621524002:1":{"text":"王不王的无所谓，我只是比你更清楚——什么叫未来。","source_cn":"王不王的无所谓，我只是比你更清楚——什么叫未来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F06AEC7BB994BA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621524003:1":{"text":"未来不是你一个猫说了算的！只要我还站着，就不会让你得逞！","source_cn":"未来不是你一个猫说了算的！只要我还站着，就不会让你得逞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD9AE100E400E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621524004:1":{"text":"站着？你抖成那样，是准备原地蹦跶吗？","source_cn":"站着？你抖成那样，是准备原地蹦跶吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A4E682F737CFB64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621524005:1":{"text":"真麻烦……非得打一架，你才肯听劝吗？","source_cn":"真麻烦……非得打一架，你才肯听劝吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBECBC0749CDA93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"